+**   RALERT_FRAMES=N     run N game frames with no delay between them, print, and leave
+**   RALERT_STOP_FRAME=N hold the picture of game frame N (RALERT_NO_DELAY=1: get there at once)
+*/
+void Video_Render_Frame();
